  "exceptionsEmptyMessage": "Exceptions allow an app at specific times, overriding other rules. Create one by choosing “Exception” as the rule type.",
  "precedenceTitle": "How rules combine",
  "precedenceBody": "When several rules apply to the same app, OpenBlock decides in this order:\n\n1. Disabled or paused rules are ignored.\n2. An active exception allows the app and overrides every other rule.\n3. A scheduled block, or a rule activated by a focus session, blocks the whole app.\n4. A daily limit blocks the app once today's measured usage reaches it.\n5. A feed block hides only the selected feeds.\n6. A pause screen asks you to wait a few seconds before continuing.\n\nIf two rules of the same type apply, the one listed first wins.",
