  "permissionAccessibilityWhy": "Lets OpenBlock notice which app is open and show the pause or block screen on top of it. Required by every rule.",
  "permissionAccessibilityObserves": "The package name of the app on screen. In apps with a feed rule, only the identifiers of on-screen elements used to recognise the feed. Never message text, passwords or what you type. Nothing is stored or sent.",
